-- Past sixteen attributes the names of a tag are kept in a set, and a
-- duplicate is still duplicate_attribute at the second, naming the line
-- of the first: `a3`, first written on line 7, again on 10 (10:9), and
-- `a16`, the seventeenth, again on 11 (11:9).
view =
    <div
        a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7
        a8 a9 a10 a11 a12 a13 a14 a15
        a16
        a3
        a16
    />
